5,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I want to make sure we don't pick something that falls apart when things get tricky! I'll check the winter road closures north of the river and the quoted delivery windows from suppliers.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I suspect we are ignoring history. I shall examine the two programmes begun six years ago and the attendance sheets from former outreach stops.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shion,,"I'm interested in who is actually doing the work. I'll look into the volunteer register and supervision training, and the neighbourhood associations and tool certification.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Minako,,"I will focus on the financial structure. I'll review the county grant terms and the endowment, as well as the running and equipment lines last year.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I worry about who can actually get to us. I'll check the bus links in the two outer wards and the evening room bookings and remote catalogue use.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
