25,2,1,talk,Yumi,,"It turns out the roads north of the river close quite a bit in winter, and those scanning contractors have delivery windows that slip whenever a bigger client comes along.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Interestingly, a digitisation project from six years ago failed to index half its images, but partner-run evening groups from that same time are still going strong.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
27,2,1,talk,Shion,,"We have retired tradespeople volunteering for repairs, but nobody on the payroll is trained to supervise outside facilitators. Also, our power tool certification expert retired.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
28,2,1,talk,Minako,,"The county grant only covers session fees for a year before the operating budget takes over. Also, vehicle running costs overran by a third last year.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
29,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Two outer wards lost their bus links, making it a long trip to the library. Also, remote catalogue use peaks very late at night.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
30,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Minako, if vehicle costs are already overrunning, does that make mobile services too expensive?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Shion, it seems we have the community will for repairs, but not the official oversight.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,2,talk,Shion,,"Exactly, Benjamin. We have the hands, but no one to sign off on the safety or the management.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Yumi, the cost is a concern, but the grant structure is the real trap. We can't afford long-term session fees.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Benjamin, the outreach attendance you looked into... did it match the bus link issues I found?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Daisuke, I wonder if the road closures make the bus issues even worse in winter.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Daisuke, yes. Former outreach stops in outer wards actually drew more people than the main building does midweek.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,3,talk,Shion,,"If we can't supervise facilitators, any program relying on outside partners is a liability.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,3,talk,Minako,,We need something that draws on the endowment for capital and doesn't rely on temporary session grants.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,It feels like the people in the outer wards are being left behind completely.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
